;; the parts of typing/env.ml (lookups, opening Stdlib), typing/typetexp.ml (core types), typing/typedecl.ml (type and
;; exception declarations), typing/datarepr.ml and typing/predef.ml (the initial environment) that the core language
;; needs (doc/ocaml/TYPER.md), whose notices follow (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
